# The needle of a search counted as a number where it is written or made by an operator on bits. Every operator that cannot join texts makes a number as surely; and a + does where each of its
# operands is a number by what makes it. (t & 3) + 0.5 is one: the list is asked for storage of numbers. (t & 3) + ".5" is none: nothing is asked.
